<!doctype lake><title>GDN Chunkwise Training</title><meta name="reading-minutes" content="31"><section class="lake-revised-section">
<h1 id="-input-projections-and-gating">🦊 Input Projections and Gating</h1>
<p>GDN 的 chunkwise 计算需要两类输入：描述当前内容的 QKV，以及控制状态更新的衰减门与写入门。Qwen3.5 的实现先在外层完成投影和短卷积，再进入 chunk 内核完成归一化、分块与累计衰减计算</p>
<figure class="lake-figure" style="width: 640px;">
  <img src="assets/15cc70833f0cd60b35726b49d8f778f8.png" alt="Gated DeltaNet 模型与 token mixer 结构，Yang et al., Figure 1，CC BY 4.0" width="2058" height="1122">
</figure>
<p>设进入 GDN 层的单个 token 表示为 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-1%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%22%7D"></card>。Qwen3.8-Flash-Next 技术报告 §2.1.1 将 QKV 的特征生成写为投影、短因果卷积与激活的复合映射；Q/K 还需沿 head 的特征维归一化。用 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-2%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cwidehat%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bq%7D%7D_t%22%7D"></card> 表示尚未乘 head dimension scaling 的归一化 query</p>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\begin{aligned}
\widehat{\boldsymbol{q}}_t
&amp;=\operatorname{L2Norm}\left(\operatorname{SiLU}\left(\operatorname{ShortConv}(\mathbf{W}_q\boldsymbol{x}_t)\right)\right),\\
\boldsymbol{k}_t
&amp;=\operatorname{L2Norm}\left(\operatorname{SiLU}\left(\operatorname{ShortConv}(\mathbf{W}_k\boldsymbol{x}_t)\right)\right),\\
\boldsymbol{v}_t
&amp;=\operatorname{SiLU}\left(\operatorname{ShortConv}(\mathbf{W}_v\boldsymbol{x}_t)\right).
\end{aligned}\tag{1}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-3%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cwidehat%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bq%7D%7D_t%5Cn%26%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7BL2Norm%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSiLU%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Coperatorname%7BShortConv%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_q%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t)%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright)%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_t%5Cn%26%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7BL2Norm%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSiLU%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Coperatorname%7BShortConv%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_k%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t)%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright)%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bv%7D_t%5Cn%26%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSiLU%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Coperatorname%7BShortConv%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_v%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t)%5C%5Cright).%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5C%5Ctag%7B1%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<p>源码将三个投影合并为 <code>in_proj_qkv</code>，并单独投影出输出门 <code>z</code>、写入参数 <code>b</code> 和衰减参数 <code>a</code>。短卷积缓存保存局部历史输入，递推缓存保存 GDN 的记忆矩阵；<code>z</code> 留待状态读出之后使用，不参与记忆更新</p>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-4%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22hidden_states%20%3D%20apply_mask_to_padding_states(hidden_states%2C%20attention_mask)%5Cnbatch_size%2C%20seq_len%2C%20_%20%3D%20hidden_states.shape%5Cnif%20cache_params%20is%20not%20None%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20conv_state%20%3D%20cache_params.get_conv_state(self.layer_idx%2C%20state_idx%3D0)%5Cn%20%20%20%20recurrent_state%20%3D%20cache_params.get_recurrent_state(self.layer_idx%2C%20state_idx%3D0)%5Cnelse%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20conv_state%2C%20recurrent_state%20%3D%20None%2C%20None%5Cn%5Cnmixed_qkv%20%3D%20self.in_proj_qkv(hidden_states)%5Cnmixed_qkv%20%3D%20mixed_qkv.transpose(1%2C%202)%5Cnz%20%3D%20self.in_proj_z(hidden_states)%5Cnz%20%3D%20z.reshape(batch_size%2C%20seq_len%2C%20-1%2C%20self.head_v_dim)%5Cnb%20%3D%20self.in_proj_b(hidden_states)%5Cna%20%3D%20self.in_proj_a(hidden_states)%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%7D"></card>
<p>短因果卷积为 QKV 提供局部时序归纳偏置，使当前位置的内容特征在本层显式融合邻近位置的信息。卷积缓存的作用是维持这一局部感受野的连续性：当输入被拆成多次调用时，新输入仍能访问调用边界左侧的投影特征，使分段处理与连续处理具有相同的卷积上下文。它保留有限窗口内的具体特征与相对顺序，保存长度由卷积核宽度决定</p>
<p>递推缓存承担更长时间尺度上的关联记忆。每个 head 用固定大小的矩阵汇总历史键值关系，并通过衰减与 delta 更新调整保留内容，使后续 query 能从历史关联中读出信息。这里存在明确的容量取舍：存储量不随历史长度增长，有限状态也无法逐项保存任意长历史中的全部关联。卷积缓存维持局部特征提取所需的时序窗口，递推缓存延续内容相关的历史记忆；续算时只保留其中一种，另一条计算路径就会在调用边界失去历史条件。chunk 划分仅改变递推的计算组织，块边界本身不构成记忆重置点</p>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-5%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22if%20cache_params%20is%20not%20None%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20mixed_qkv%20%3D%20cache_params.update_conv_state(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20mixed_qkv%2C%20self.layer_idx%2C%20conv_kernel_size%3Dself.conv_kernel_size)%5Cnmixed_qkv%20%3D%20causal_conv1d_fn(%5Cn%20%20%20%20mixed_qkv%2C%20self.conv1d.weight.squeeze(1)%2C%20self.conv1d.bias%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20activation%3Dself.activation%2C%20**kwargs)%5Cnif%20cache_params%20is%20not%20None%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20mixed_qkv%20%3D%20mixed_qkv%5B%3A%2C%20%3A%2C%20-seq_len%3A%5D%5Cn%5Cnmixed_qkv%20%3D%20mixed_qkv.transpose(1%2C%202)%5Cnquery%2C%20key%2C%20value%20%3D%20torch.split(mixed_qkv%2C%20%5Bself.key_dim%2C%20self.key_dim%2C%20self.value_dim%5D%2C%20dim%3D-1)%5Cnquery%20%3D%20query.reshape(batch_size%2C%20seq_len%2C%20-1%2C%20self.head_k_dim)%5Cnkey%20%3D%20key.reshape(batch_size%2C%20seq_len%2C%20-1%2C%20self.head_k_dim)%5Cnvalue%20%3D%20value.reshape(batch_size%2C%20seq_len%2C%20-1%2C%20self.head_v_dim)%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%7D"></card>
<p>两个状态门按 token、按 value head 生成标量。记 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-6%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22A_h%22%7D"></card> 和 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-7%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22d_h%22%7D"></card> 分别对应 <code>A_log</code> 与 <code>dt_bias</code> 在 head <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-8%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22h%22%7D"></card> 上的参数，则</p>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\beta_t=\sigma(b_t),\qquad
g_t=-\exp(A_h)\operatorname{softplus}(a_t+d_h),\qquad
\alpha_t=\exp(g_t).
\tag{2}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-9%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_t%3D%5C%5Csigma(b_t)%2C%5C%5Cqquad%5Cng_t%3D-%5C%5Cexp(A_h)%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bsoftplus%7D(a_t%2Bd_h)%2C%5C%5Cqquad%5Cn%5C%5Calpha_t%3D%5C%5Cexp(g_t).%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B2%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<p><code>g</code> 直接存储 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-10%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clog%5C%5Calpha%22%7D"></card>。负指数参数化使实际衰减因子处于 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-11%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22(0%2C1)%22%7D"></card>，<code>beta</code> 则控制当前键值关联的更新强度。当 value head 数更多时，这一实现重复 Q/K 的 head，使每个 value head 有对应的 query 和 key</p>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-12%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22beta%20%3D%20b.sigmoid()%5Cng%20%3D%20-self.A_log.float().exp()%20*%20F.softplus(a.float()%20%2B%20self.dt_bias)%5Cnif%20self.num_v_heads%20%2F%2F%20self.num_k_heads%20%3E%201%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20query%20%3D%20query.repeat_interleave(self.num_v_heads%20%2F%2F%20self.num_k_heads%2C%20dim%3D2)%5Cn%20%20%20%20key%20%3D%20key.repeat_interleave(self.num_v_heads%20%2F%2F%20self.num_k_heads%2C%20dim%3D2)%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%7D"></card>
<p>对单个 head，衰减因子 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-13%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%22%7D"></card> 控制历史状态的整体保留比例，更新强度 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-14%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_t%22%7D"></card> 控制沿当前 key 方向的旧关联消除与新关联写入；key 的范数因此直接影响状态更新的尺度。其状态更新为</p>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\mathbf{S}_t=\mathbf{S}_{t-1}\left(\alpha_t\left(\mathbf{I}-\beta_t\boldsymbol{k}_t\boldsymbol{k}_t^{\intercal}\right)\right)+\beta_t\boldsymbol{v}_t\boldsymbol{k}_t^{\intercal}\in\mathbb{R}^{d_v\times d_k}.\tag{3}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-15%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_t%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Calpha_t%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D-%5C%5Cbeta_t%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_t%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_t%5E%7B%5C%5Cintercal%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright)%2B%5C%5Cbeta_t%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bv%7D_t%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_t%5E%7B%5C%5Cintercal%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_v%5C%5Ctimes%20d_k%7D.%5C%5Ctag%7B3%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
</section><section class="lake-revised-section">
<h1 id="-normalization-and-chunkwise-decay">🦉 Normalization and Chunkwise Decay</h1>
<p><code>torch_chunk_gated_delta_rule</code> 按 head 独立组织序列计算。这条 PyTorch 实现将核心中间量转换为 FP32，以减小归一化、累计衰减与状态更新中的舍入误差。Q/K 的归一化分别作用于每个 token、每个 head 内的特征向量，归约范围仅限特征维，不引入不同 token 或 head 之间的信息混合</p>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-16%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22initial_dtype%20%3D%20query.dtype%5Cnbatch_size%2C%20sequence_length%2C%20_%2C%20k_head_dim%20%3D%20key.shape%5Cnnum_v_heads%2C%20v_head_dim%20%3D%20value.shape%5B-2%3A%5D%5Cnrecurrent_state_shape%20%3D%20(batch_size%2C%20num_v_heads%2C%20k_head_dim%2C%20v_head_dim)%5Cnpadded_output_shape%20%3D%20(batch_size%2C%20num_v_heads%2C%20-1%2C%20v_head_dim)%5Cndecay%20%3D%20g%5Cnquery%2C%20key%2C%20value%2C%20beta%2C%20decay%20%3D%20%5B%5Cn%20%20%20%20x.transpose(1%2C%202).to(torch.float32%2C%20memory_format%3Dtorch.contiguous_format)%5Cn%20%20%20%20for%20x%20in%20(query%2C%20key%2C%20value%2C%20beta%2C%20decay)%5Cn%5D%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%7D"></card>
<p>L2 归一化使 Q/K 的关联匹配主要取决于特征方向，从而降低上游投影幅值波动的影响。对 key，范数约束使沿当前方向的擦除比例主要受写入门控制；对 query，它约束查询向量对记忆读出的放大作用。数值稳定项 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-17%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cvarepsilon%22%7D"></card> 避免分母在原点退化，使近零输入处的映射保持连续，零向量仍映射为零。归一化后施加的 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-18%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22d_k%5E%7B-1%2F2%7D%22%7D"></card> 用于调整 query 的读出尺度，不参与状态更新</p>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\operatorname{L2Norm}_{\varepsilon}(\boldsymbol{x})
=\frac{\boldsymbol{x}}{\sqrt{\sum_{r=1}^{d_k}x_r^2+\varepsilon}},
\qquad
\boldsymbol{q}_t=\frac{\widehat{\boldsymbol{q}}_t}{\sqrt{d_k}},
\qquad \varepsilon=10^{-6}.
\tag{4}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-19%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BL2Norm%7D_%7B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D)%5Cn%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Csum_%7Br%3D1%7D%5E%7Bd_k%7Dx_r%5E2%2B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%7D%7D%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%5Cn%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bq%7D_t%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cwidehat%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bq%7D%7D_t%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7Bd_k%7D%7D%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cvarepsilon%3D10%5E%7B-6%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B4%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<p>结合式（3），归一化保证 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-20%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_t%5C%5C%7C_2%5C%5Cleq1%22%7D"></card>，使秩一修正算子 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-21%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D-%5C%5Cbeta_t%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_t%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_t%5E%7B%5C%5Cintercal%7D%22%7D"></card> 沿 key 方向的特征值 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-22%22%2C%22code%22%3A%221-%5C%5Cbeta_t%5C%5C%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_t%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%22%7D"></card> 位于 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-23%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5B0%2C1%5D%22%7D"></card>，在其正交子空间上的特征值为 1。因此，对固定的 key 与门控，该算子不会放大已有状态的扰动；进一步乘以 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-24%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%22%7D"></card> 则施加整体衰减。这一性质约束历史状态的传播增益，不限制每一步新写入的 value 项的幅度</p>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-25%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22def%20l2norm(x%2C%20dim%3D-1%2C%20eps%3D1e-6)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20inv_norm%20%3D%20torch.rsqrt((x%20*%20x).sum(dim%3Ddim%2C%20keepdim%3DTrue)%20%2B%20eps)%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20x%20*%20inv_norm%5Cn%5Cnif%20use_qk_l2norm_in_kernel%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20query%20%3D%20l2norm(query%2C%20dim%3D-1%2C%20eps%3D1e-6)%5Cn%20%20%20%20key%20%3D%20l2norm(key%2C%20dim%3D-1%2C%20eps%3D1e-6)%5Cnscaling%20%3D%20query.shape%5B-1%5D%20**%20-0.5%5Cnquery%20%3D%20query%20*%20scaling%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%7D"></card>
<p>随后按默认块长 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-26%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22C%3D64%22%7D"></card> 划分序列；长度 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-27%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22T%3D128%22%7D"></card> 对应两个完整 chunk，不能整除时仅在序列尾部补齐。预先计算 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-28%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta%20K%22%7D"></card> 与 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-29%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta%20V%22%7D"></card>，使逐 token 的写入权重显式进入后续块内线性系统：<code>v_beta</code> 作为第一组三角求解的右端项，<code>k_beta</code> 参与构造系统系数，并在乘累计衰减后构成另一右端项。补齐位置取 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-30%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta%3D0%22%7D"></card>、<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-31%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22g%3D0%22%7D"></card>，分别对应零写入强度与单位衰减因子，因此不会改变有效序列结束处的递推状态</p>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-32%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22pad_size%20%3D%20(chunk_size%20-%20sequence_length%20%25%20chunk_size)%20%25%20chunk_size%5Cnquery%2C%20key%2C%20value%20%3D%20(F.pad(x%2C%20(0%2C%200%2C%200%2C%20pad_size))%20for%20x%20in%20(query%2C%20key%2C%20value))%5Cnbeta%2C%20decay%20%3D%20(F.pad(x%2C%20(0%2C%20pad_size))%20for%20x%20in%20(beta%2C%20decay))%5Cntotal_sequence_length%20%3D%20sequence_length%20%2B%20pad_size%5Cnnum_chunks%20%3D%20total_sequence_length%20%2F%2F%20chunk_size%5Cnv_beta%20%3D%20value%20*%20beta.unsqueeze(-1)%5Cnk_beta%20%3D%20key%20*%20beta.unsqueeze(-1)%5Cn%23%20query%2Fkey%2Fk_beta%3A%20%5BB%2C%20H%2C%20num_chunks%2C%20chunk_size%2C%20d_k%5D%5Cn%23%20v_beta%3A%20%5BB%2C%20H%2C%20num_chunks%2C%20chunk_size%2C%20d_v%5D%5Cnquery%2C%20key%2C%20k_beta%2C%20v_beta%20%3D%20%5B%5Cn%20%20%20%20x.reshape(x.shape%5B0%5D%2C%20x.shape%5B1%5D%2C%20-1%2C%20chunk_size%2C%20x.shape%5B-1%5D)%5Cn%20%20%20%20for%20x%20in%20(query%2C%20key%2C%20k_beta%2C%20v_beta)%5Cn%5D%5Cn%23%20decay%3A%20%5BB%2C%20H%2C%20num_chunks%2C%20chunk_size%5D%5Cndecay%20%3D%20decay.reshape(decay.shape%5B0%5D%2C%20decay.shape%5B1%5D%2C%20-1%2C%20chunk_size)%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%7D"></card>
<p>对固定的 batch、head 和 chunk，使用块内下标 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-33%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22i%3D1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2CC%22%7D"></card>。累计衰减 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-34%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma_i%22%7D"></card> 与代码中的累计对数衰减 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-35%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22G_i%22%7D"></card> 满足</p>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\gamma_i=\prod_{r=1}^{i}\alpha_r,
\qquad
G_i=\sum_{r=1}^{i}g_r=\log\gamma_i,
\qquad \gamma_0=1,\quad G_0=0.
\tag{5}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-36%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma_i%3D%5C%5Cprod_%7Br%3D1%7D%5E%7Bi%7D%5C%5Calpha_r%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%5CnG_i%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Br%3D1%7D%5E%7Bi%7Dg_r%3D%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cgamma_i%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cgamma_0%3D1%2C%5C%5Cquad%20G_0%3D0.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B5%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<p>衰减因果矩阵在下三角使用前缀衰减的比值，上三角为零；行 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-37%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22i%22%7D"></card> 表示当前读出位置，列 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-38%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22j%22%7D"></card> 表示历史写入位置</p>
<p>每个 chunk 独立建立累计衰减的参照点，跨块历史仍通过入口 <code>recurrent_state</code> 传递。由于 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-39%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22g%5C%5Cleq0%22%7D"></card>，下三角差值非正；先把上三角置为 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-40%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22-%5C%5Cinfty%22%7D"></card> 再取指数，可同时实现因果屏蔽并避免未来位置的正指数溢出。所得 <code>pairwise_decay</code> 对应式（6）的 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-41%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5CGamma%7D%22%7D"></card>，对角线为 1，上三角为 0</p>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\boldsymbol{\Gamma}=
\begin{pmatrix}
1 &amp; 0 &amp; \cdots &amp; 0\\
\gamma_2/\gamma_1 &amp; 1 &amp; \cdots &amp; 0\\
\vdots &amp; \vdots &amp; \ddots &amp; \vdots\\
\gamma_C/\gamma_1 &amp; \gamma_C/\gamma_2 &amp; \cdots &amp; 1
\end{pmatrix},
\qquad
\Gamma_{ij}=
\begin{cases}
\displaystyle\frac{\gamma_i}{\gamma_j}
=\prod_{r=j+1}^{i}\alpha_r
=\exp(G_i-G_j), &amp; i\geq j,\\
0, &amp; i&lt;j.
\end{cases}
\tag{6}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-42%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5CGamma%7D%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Bpmatrix%7D%5Cn1%20%26%200%20%26%20%5C%5Ccdots%20%26%200%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cgamma_2%2F%5C%5Cgamma_1%20%26%201%20%26%20%5C%5Ccdots%20%26%200%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cvdots%20%26%20%5C%5Cvdots%20%26%20%5C%5Cddots%20%26%20%5C%5Cvdots%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cgamma_C%2F%5C%5Cgamma_1%20%26%20%5C%5Cgamma_C%2F%5C%5Cgamma_2%20%26%20%5C%5Ccdots%20%26%201%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bpmatrix%7D%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%5Cn%5C%5CGamma_%7Bij%7D%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cgamma_i%7D%7B%5C%5Cgamma_j%7D%5Cn%3D%5C%5Cprod_%7Br%3Dj%2B1%7D%5E%7Bi%7D%5C%5Calpha_r%5Cn%3D%5C%5Cexp(G_i-G_j)%2C%20%26%20i%5C%5Cgeq%20j%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn0%2C%20%26%20i%3Cj.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B6%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<p><strong>对数空间把累计连乘变成求和，把前缀积相除变成累计和相减。</strong> <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-43%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma_i%2F%5C%5Cgamma_j%22%7D"></card> 消去写入位置及其之前的公共前缀，只保留从 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-44%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22j%2B1%22%7D"></card> 到 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-45%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22i%22%7D"></card> 的衰减；当 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-46%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22i%3Dj%22%7D"></card> 时，空乘积为 1。实现直接计算 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-47%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22G_i-G_j%22%7D"></card>，避免分别生成可能已经下溢的两个前缀积，再进行不稳定的相除</p>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-48%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22strictly_upper_mask%20%3D%20torch.ones(%5Cn%20%20%20%20chunk_size%2C%20chunk_size%2C%20dtype%3Dtorch.bool%2C%20device%3Dquery.device).triu(1)%5Cncum_decay%20%3D%20decay.cumsum(dim%3D3)%20%20%23%20%E5%9C%A8%E6%AF%8F%E4%B8%AA%20chunk%20%E5%86%85%E7%B4%AF%E8%AE%A1%5Cn%23%20pairwise_decay%3A%20%5BB%2C%20H%2C%20num_chunks%2C%20chunk_size%2C%20chunk_size%5D%5Cnpairwise_decay%20%3D%20cum_decay.unsqueeze(4)%20-%20cum_decay.unsqueeze(3)%5Cnpairwise_decay%20%3D%20pairwise_decay.masked_fill(strictly_upper_mask%2C%20float(%5C%22-inf%5C%22))%5Cnpairwise_decay%20%3D%20pairwise_decay.exp()%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%7D"></card>
</section><section class="lake-revised-section">
<h1 id="-mamba2-linear-attention-with-decay">🐨 Mamba2: Linear Attention with Decay</h1>
<p><strong>前面的累计衰减确定历史写入如何传播；接下来需要把入口记忆与块内写入的贡献分开，才能组织 chunkwise 计算。先从加性线性注意力出发，将特征映射吸收到 Q/K 中，其递推形式为</strong></p>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="S_t=S_{t-1}+v_tk_t^\top\in\mathbb{R}^{d_v\times d_k}, \quad o_t=S_tq_t\in\mathbb{R}^{d_v}
\tag{7}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-49%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22S_t%3DS_%7Bt-1%7D%2Bv_tk_t%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_v%5C%5Ctimes%20d_k%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20o_t%3DS_tq_t%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_v%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B7%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li>其中 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-50%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22d_k%22%7D"></card> 和 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-51%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22d_v%22%7D"></card> 分别表示查询/键和值的注意力头维度。以下全序列展开取初态 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-52%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22S_0%3D0%22%7D"></card>，分别得到向量形式和矩阵形式</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="o_t=\sum_{i=1}^{t}(v_ik_i^\top)q_t =\sum_{i=1}^{t}v_i(k_i^\top q_t)\in\mathbb{R}^{d_v}, \quad O=(QK^\top\odot M)V\in\mathbb{R}^{L\times d_v}
\tag{8}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-53%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22o_t%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Bt%7D(v_ik_i%5E%5C%5Ctop)q_t%20%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Bt%7Dv_i(k_i%5E%5C%5Ctop%20q_t)%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_v%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20O%3D(QK%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Codot%20M)V%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BL%5C%5Ctimes%20d_v%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B8%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li>其中 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-54%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22L%22%7D"></card> 表示序列长度， <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-55%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22M%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BL%5C%5Ctimes%20L%7D%22%7D"></card> 为因果掩码：当 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-56%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22i%3Cj%22%7D"></card> 时 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-57%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22M_%7Bij%7D%3D0%22%7D"></card>；否则 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-58%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22M_%7Bij%7D%3D1%22%7D"></card></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>基础的线性注意力在语言建模任务上的性能远逊于标准 Transformer。为解决这一问题，一种常见做法是引入衰减项，以遗忘历史信息。以 Mamba2 为例，其可以表示为如下线性递推形式</strong></p>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="S_t=\alpha_tS_{t-1}+v_tk_t^\top, \quad o_t=S_tq_t
\tag{9}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-59%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22S_t%3D%5C%5Calpha_tS_%7Bt-1%7D%2Bv_tk_t%5E%5C%5Ctop%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20o_t%3DS_tq_t%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B9%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li>其中 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-60%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%5C%5Cin(0%2C1)%22%7D"></card> 是一个随时间步 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-61%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%22%7D"></card> 变化、依赖于输入数据的标量衰减项。定义累积衰减乘积 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-62%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma_j%3D%5C%5Cprod_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Bj%7D%5C%5Calpha_i%22%7D"></card>。通过展开上述递推关系，可以分别得到如下向量形式和矩阵并行形式</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="o_t=\sum_{i=1}^{t}\frac{\gamma_t}{\gamma_i}v_ik_i^\top q_t =\sum_{i=1}^{t}v_i\left(\frac{\gamma_t}{\gamma_i}k_i^\top q_t\right), \quad O=\bigl((QK^\top)\odot\Gamma\bigr)V.
\tag{10}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-63%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22o_t%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Bt%7D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cgamma_t%7D%7B%5C%5Cgamma_i%7Dv_ik_i%5E%5C%5Ctop%20q_t%20%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Bt%7Dv_i%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cgamma_t%7D%7B%5C%5Cgamma_i%7Dk_i%5E%5C%5Ctop%20q_t%5C%5Cright)%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20O%3D%5C%5Cbigl((QK%5E%5C%5Ctop)%5C%5Codot%5C%5CGamma%5C%5Cbigr)V.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B10%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\Gamma_{ij}= \begin{cases} \frac{\gamma_i}{\gamma_j}, &amp; i\ge j\\ 0, &amp; i&lt;j \end{cases}
\tag{11}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-64%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CGamma_%7Bij%7D%3D%20%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cgamma_i%7D%7B%5C%5Cgamma_j%7D%2C%20%26%20i%5C%5Cge%20j%5C%5C%5C%5C%200%2C%20%26%20i%3Cj%20%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B11%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-65%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CGamma%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BL%5C%5Ctimes%20L%7D%22%7D"></card> 是一个考虑衰减效应的因果掩码。上述并行形式与递推形式之间的等价关系也被称为状态空间对偶性</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>为实现硬件友好的线性时间训练，通常采用分块并行形式。分块并行方法将输入和输出划分为若干大小为</strong> <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-66%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22C%22%7D"></card> <strong>的分块，并依据前一个分块的最终状态以及当前分块的查询、键和值矩阵计算当前分块的输出</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>定义 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-67%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22Q_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%3D%5Bq_%7BtC%2B1%7D%2C%5C%5Cldots%2Cq_%7B(t%2B1)C%7D%5D%5E%5C%5Ctop%22%7D"></card> 为第 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-68%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%22%7D"></card> 个分块的查询矩阵，并定义 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-69%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%3A%3Dq_%7BtC%2Br%7D%22%7D"></card> 为第 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-70%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%22%7D"></card> 个分块内的第 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-71%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22r%22%7D"></card> 个查询向量。第 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-72%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%22%7D"></card> 个分块的初始状态定义为 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-73%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22S_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%3A%3DS_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E0%3DS_%7B%5Bt-1%5D%7D%5EC%22%7D"></card>。先对无衰减的线性注意力递推进行部分展开，可以得到</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="S_{[t]}^r =S_{[t]}+\sum_{i=1}^{r}v_{[t]}^i{k_{[t]}^i}^{\top} \in\mathbb{R}^{d_v\times d_k}, \quad o_{[t]}^r =S_{[t]}^rq_{[t]}^r =S_{[t]}q_{[t]}^r +\sum_{i=1}^{r}v_{[t]}^i \left({k_{[t]}^i}^{\top}q_{[t]}^r\right) \in\mathbb{R}^{d_v}
\tag{12}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-74%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22S_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%20%3DS_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%2B%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Br%7Dv_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7Bk_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%20%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_v%5C%5Ctimes%20d_k%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20o_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%20%3DS_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Erq_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%20%3DS_%7B%5Bt%5D%7Dq_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%20%2B%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Br%7Dv_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%20%5C%5Cleft(%7Bk_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7Dq_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_v%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B12%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="S_{[t+1]} =S_{[t]}+V_{[t]}^\top K_{[t]} \in\mathbb{R}^{d_v\times d_k}, \quad O_{[t]} =Q_{[t]}S_{[t]}^\top +\bigl(Q_{[t]}K_{[t]}^\top\odot M\bigr)V_{[t]} \in\mathbb{R}^{C\times d_v}
\tag{13}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-75%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22S_%7B%5Bt%2B1%5D%7D%20%3DS_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%2BV_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_v%5C%5Ctimes%20d_k%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20O_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%3DQ_%7B%5Bt%5D%7DS_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%2B%5C%5Cbigl(Q_%7B%5Bt%5D%7DK_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Codot%20M%5C%5Cbigr)V_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BC%5C%5Ctimes%20d_v%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B13%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li>其中 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-76%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22M%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BC%5C%5Ctimes%20C%7D%22%7D"></card> 是分块内部的因果掩码。上述方程主要由矩阵乘法运算构成，因此可以充分利用张量核心进行硬件层面的优化。<strong>这种分块算法也可以方便地扩展至包含衰减项的线性注意力</strong></li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="S_{[t+1]} =\overrightarrow{S}_{[t]} +V_{[t]}^\top\overrightarrow{K}_{[t]} \in\mathbb{R}^{d_v\times d_k}, \quad O_{[t]} =\overleftarrow{Q}_{[t]}S_{[t]}^\top +\bigl(Q_{[t]}K_{[t]}^\top\odot\Gamma_{[t]}\bigr)V_{[t]} \in\mathbb{R}^{C\times d_v}.
\tag{14}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-77%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22S_%7B%5Bt%2B1%5D%7D%20%3D%5C%5Coverrightarrow%7BS%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%2BV_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Coverrightarrow%7BK%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_v%5C%5Ctimes%20d_k%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20O_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%3D%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7BQ%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7DS_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%2B%5C%5Cbigl(Q_%7B%5Bt%5D%7DK_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Codot%5C%5CGamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cbigr)V_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BC%5C%5Ctimes%20d_v%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B14%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="(\Gamma_{[t]})_{ij} = \begin{cases}\gamma_{[t]}^i/\gamma_{[t]}^j,&amp;i\ge j,\\0,&amp;i&lt;j,\end{cases}\qquad \gamma_{[t]}^j = \prod_{\ell=tC+1}^{tC+j}\alpha_\ell.
\tag{15}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-78%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22(%5C%5CGamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D)_%7Bij%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%2F%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ej%2C%26i%5C%5Cge%20j%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C0%2C%26i%3Cj%2C%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ej%20%3D%20%5C%5Cprod_%7B%5C%5Cell%3DtC%2B1%7D%5E%7BtC%2Bj%7D%5C%5Calpha_%5C%5Cell.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B15%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li>使用左箭头 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-79%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B(%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5C%2C)%7D%22%7D"></card> 和右箭头 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-80%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coverrightarrow%7B(%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5C%2C)%7D%22%7D"></card>，分别表示将变量衰减至每个分块的首位置和末位置</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\begin{aligned}
{\color{blue}\overleftarrow{\boldsymbol{q}_{[t]}^r}} &amp;= {\color{blue}\gamma_{[t]}^r} \boldsymbol{q}_{[t]}^r &amp;&amp; \text{decaying each vector to the first position of chunk } t \\
{\color{blue}\overrightarrow{\boldsymbol{k}_{[t]}^r}} &amp;= \frac{{\color{blue}\gamma_{[t]}^C}}{{\color{blue}\gamma_{[t]}^r}} \boldsymbol{k}_{[t]}^r &amp;&amp; \text{decaying each vector to the last position of chunk } t \\
{\color{blue}\overrightarrow{\mathbf{S}_{[t]}}} &amp;= {\color{blue}\gamma_{[t]}^C} \mathbf{S}_{[t]} &amp;&amp; \text{decaying the state matrix over the entire chunk } t
\end{aligned}
\tag{16}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-81%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bblue%7D%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bq%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%7D%20%26%3D%20%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bblue%7D%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bq%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%20%26%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bdecaying%20each%20vector%20to%20the%20first%20position%20of%20chunk%20%7D%20t%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bblue%7D%5C%5Coverrightarrow%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%7D%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bblue%7D%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5EC%7D%7D%7B%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bblue%7D%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%20%26%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bdecaying%20each%20vector%20to%20the%20last%20position%20of%20chunk%20%7D%20t%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bblue%7D%5C%5Coverrightarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%7D%7D%20%26%3D%20%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bblue%7D%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5EC%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%26%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bdecaying%20the%20state%20matrix%20over%20the%20entire%20chunk%20%7D%20t%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B16%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<p><strong>上述分块形式把输出分成入口记忆的读出与块内写入的贡献。Q、K、V 及衰减均由当前块输入确定，因此块内矩阵可并行准备，块间通过</strong> <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-82%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22S_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%22%7D"></card> <strong>延续历史。DeltaNet 的困难在于：当前写入还依赖旧状态中的关联预测</strong></p>
</section><section class="lake-revised-section">
<h1 id="-delta-networks-linear-attention-with-delta-rule">🦌 Delta Networks: Linear Attention with Delta Rule</h1>
<p><strong>DeltaNet 先用当前 key 从上一状态读取预测值</strong> <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-83%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22S_%7Bt-1%7Dk_t%22%7D"></card> <strong>，用当前 value 减去该预测，再将残差乘以写入强度</strong> <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-84%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_t%5C%5Cin(0%2C1)%22%7D"></card> <strong>，沿当前 key 方向修正记忆</strong></p>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="S_t=S_{t-1}+\beta_t(v_t-S_{t-1}k_t)k_t^{\top}=S_{t-1}(I-\beta_t k_t k_t^{\top})+\beta_t v_t k_t^{\top}.\tag{17}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-85%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22S_t%3DS_%7Bt-1%7D%2B%5C%5Cbeta_t(v_t-S_%7Bt-1%7Dk_t)k_t%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%3DS_%7Bt-1%7D(I-%5C%5Cbeta_t%20k_t%20k_t%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D)%2B%5C%5Cbeta_t%20v_t%20k_t%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D.%5C%5Ctag%7B17%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li><strong>状态转移矩阵</strong> <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-86%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22I-%5C%5Cbeta_tk_tk_t%5E%5C%5Ctop%22%7D"></card> <strong>是广义 Householder 形式。写入残差依赖上一状态，不能直接像式（14）那样由输入独立构造；需要先把这部分状态依赖显式分离</strong></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Chunkwise parallel form：分块并行与 WY 表示法</strong></p>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\mathbf{S}_{[t]}^r = \mathbf{S}_{[t]} \underbrace{\left( \prod_{i=1}^r \left(\mathbf{I} - \beta_{[t]}^i \boldsymbol{k}_{[t]}^i {\boldsymbol{k}_{[t]}^i}^\top\right) \right)}_{:=\mathbf{P}_{[t]}^r} + \underbrace{\sum_{i=1}^r \left( \beta_{[t]}^i \boldsymbol{v}_{[t]}^i {\boldsymbol{k}_{[t]}^i}^\top \prod_{j=i+1}^r \left( \mathbf{I} - \beta_{[t]}^j \boldsymbol{k}_{[t]}^j {\boldsymbol{k}_{[t]}^j}^\top \right) \right)}_{:=\mathbf{H}_{[t]}^r}
\tag{18}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-87%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cprod_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5Er%20%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D%20-%20%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%20%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cright)%7D_%7B%3A%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5Er%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bv%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%20%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cprod_%7Bj%3Di%2B1%7D%5Er%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D%20-%20%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ej%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ej%20%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ej%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cright)%7D_%7B%3A%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B18%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li><strong>WY 表示法：将有序矩阵连乘改写为外积和。</strong> <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-88%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22P_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%22%7D"></card> 中逐 token 累乘的状态转移矩阵可写成 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-89%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22I-%5C%5Csum_i%20w_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7Bk_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%22%7D"></card>，块内累计写入则写成 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-90%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csum_i%20u_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7Bk_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%22%7D"></card>。这使历史状态变换与新增写入分别由 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-91%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22W%22%7D"></card>、<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-92%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22U%22%7D"></card> 表示，为矩阵化计算提供代数形式；此时 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-93%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22w%5Er%22%7D"></card>、<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-94%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22u%5Er%22%7D"></card> 的定义仍包含对先前位置的递推依赖</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\mathbf{P}_{[t]}^r = \mathbf{I} - \sum_{i=1}^r \mathbf{w}_{[t]}^i {\boldsymbol{k}_{[t]}^i}^\top \in \mathbb{R}^{d_k \times d_k} \qquad \mathbf{w}_{[t]}^r = \beta_{[t]}^r \left( \boldsymbol{k}_{[t]}^r - \sum_{i=1}^{r-1} \left( \mathbf{w}_{[t]}^i ({\boldsymbol{k}_{[t]}^i}^\top \boldsymbol{k}_{[t]}^r) \right) \right) \in \mathbb{R}^{d_k}
\tag{19}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-95%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D%20-%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5Er%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%20%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_k%20%5C%5Ctimes%20d_k%7D%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%20%3D%20%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%20-%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Br-1%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%20(%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er)%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_k%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B19%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\mathbf{H}_{[t]}^r = \sum_{i=1}^r \mathbf{u}_{[t]}^i {\boldsymbol{k}_{[t]}^i}^\top \in \mathbb{R}^{d_v \times d_k} \qquad \mathbf{u}_{[t]}^r = \beta_{[t]}^r \left( \boldsymbol{v}_{[t]}^r - \sum_{i=1}^{r-1} \left( \mathbf{u}_{[t]}^i ({\boldsymbol{k}_{[t]}^i}^\top \boldsymbol{k}_{[t]}^r) \right) \right) \in \mathbb{R}^{d_v}
\tag{20}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-96%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%20%3D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5Er%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%20%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_v%20%5C%5Ctimes%20d_k%7D%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%20%3D%20%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bv%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%20-%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Br-1%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%20(%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er)%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_v%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B20%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li>将各位置的 w、u 分别按行排列为 W、U，并取 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-97%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22r%3DC%22%7D"></card>，上述 WY 表示写成块级矩阵形式</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\mathbf{P}_{[t]} = \mathbf{I} - \mathbf{W}_{[t]}^\top \mathbf{K}_{[t]} \in \mathbb{R}^{d_k \times d_k}, \qquad \mathbf{H}_{[t]} = \mathbf{U}_{[t]}^\top \mathbf{K}_{[t]} \in \mathbb{R}^{d_v \times d_k}
\tag{21}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-98%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D%20-%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_k%20%5C%5Ctimes%20d_k%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BU%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_v%20%5C%5Ctimes%20d_k%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B21%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li><strong>UT 变换：将 W、U 的递推依赖组织为共享系数的下三角线性系统。</strong> 系统系数由块内 key 的 Gram 矩阵与写入门构成，两个右端项分别为 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-99%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(%5C%5Cbeta)K%22%7D"></card> 与 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-100%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(%5C%5Cbeta)V%22%7D"></card>。式（22）以 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-101%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22T%22%7D"></card> 表示同一求解算子，使 W、U 可通过块级三角求解和矩阵乘法共同计算；逆矩阵是代数记号，实现无需显式构造一般矩阵的逆。<strong style="color: var(--fgColor-danger)">WY 给出紧凑表示，UT 给出计算该表示的块级方法</strong></li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\mathbf{T}_{[t]} = \left[ \mathbf{I} + \text{strictLower} \left( \text{diag}(\beta_{[t]}) \mathbf{K}_{[t]} \mathbf{K}_{[t]}^\top \right) \right]^{-1} \text{diag} (\beta_{[t]}) \in \mathbb{R}^{C \times C}
\tag{22}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-102%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BT%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Ctext%7BstrictLower%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bdiag%7D(%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D)%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cright%5D%5E%7B-1%7D%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bdiag%7D%20(%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D)%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BC%20%5C%5Ctimes%20C%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B22%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\mathbf{W}_{[t]} = \mathbf{T}_{[t]} \mathbf{K}_{[t]} \in \mathbb{R}^{C \times d_k}, \qquad \mathbf{U}_{[t]} = \mathbf{T}_{[t]} \mathbf{V}_{[t]} \in \mathbb{R}^{C \times d_v}
\tag{23}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-103%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BT%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BC%20%5C%5Ctimes%20d_k%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BU%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BT%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BC%20%5C%5Ctimes%20d_v%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B23%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li>将 WY 表示与 UT 变换得到的 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-104%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22W%22%7D"></card>、<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-105%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22U%22%7D"></card> 代回后，<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-106%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22U-WS_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%22%7D"></card> 表示当前块相对于入口状态的有效写入。块内输出和块末状态更新由矩阵乘法完成，从而利用 Tensor Core；块间仍通过 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-107%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22S_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%22%7D"></card> 传递历史状态</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\mathbf{S}_{[t+1]} = \mathbf{S}_{[t]}\mathbf{P}_{[t]} + \mathbf{H}_{[t]} = \mathbf{S}_{[t]} + \left(\mathbf{U}_{[t]} - \mathbf{W}_{[t]}\mathbf{S}_{[t]}^\top \right)^\top \mathbf{K}_{[t]} \in \mathbb{R}^{d_v \times d_k}
\tag{24}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-108%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7B%5Bt%2B1%5D%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BU%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20-%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cright)%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_v%20%5C%5Ctimes%20d_k%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B24%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\mathbf{O}_{[t]} = \mathbf{Q}_{[t]}\mathbf{S}_{[t]}^\top + \left(\mathbf{Q}_{[t]}\mathbf{K}_{[t]}^\top \odot \mathbf{M} \right) \left(\mathbf{U}_{[t]} - \mathbf{W}_{[t]}\mathbf{S}_{[t]}^\top \right) \in \mathbb{R}^{C \times d_v}
\tag{25}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-109%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BO%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BQ%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%2B%20%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BQ%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Codot%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BM%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BU%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20-%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BC%20%5C%5Ctimes%20d_v%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B25%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
</section><section class="lake-revised-section">
<h1 id="-wy-representation">🐧 WY Representation</h1>
<p>式（19）、（20）的 WY 表示可按 <em>Parallelizing Linear Transformers with the Delta Rule over Sequence Length</em> 附录 B.1 作归纳证明。关键在于：<strong style="color: var(--fgColor-danger)">每次右乘新的更新因子，新增项仍以当前 key 为右因子，因此有序连乘可持续表示为向量外积和</strong></p>
<p>当 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-110%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22r%3D1%22%7D"></card> 时，<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-111%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E1%3D%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E1%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E1%22%7D"></card>。假设式（19）对 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-112%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22r-1%22%7D"></card> 成立，将第 r 个更新因子右乘到累计变换上</p>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\begin{aligned}
\mathbf{P}_{[t]}^r &amp;=\mathbf{P}_{[t]}^{r-1}\left(\mathbf I-\beta_{[t]}^r\boldsymbol{k}_{[t]}^r{\boldsymbol{k}_{[t]}^r}^{\top}\right) =\left(\mathbf I-\sum_{i=1}^{r-1}\mathbf w_{[t]}^i{\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^i}^{\top}\right) \left(\mathbf I-\beta_{[t]}^r\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^r{\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^r}^{\top}\right)\\
&amp;=\mathbf I-\sum_{i=1}^{r-1}\mathbf w_{[t]}^i{\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^i}^{\top} -\beta_{[t]}^r\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^r{\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^r}^{\top} +\beta_{[t]}^r\sum_{i=1}^{r-1}\mathbf w_{[t]}^i \left({\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^i}^{\top}\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^r\right){\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^r}^{\top}\\
&amp;=\mathbf I-\sum_{i=1}^{r-1}\mathbf w_{[t]}^i{\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^i}^{\top} -\underbrace{\beta_{[t]}^r\left(\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^r-\sum_{i=1}^{r-1}\mathbf w_{[t]}^i \left({\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^i}^{\top}\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^r\right)\right)}_{\mathbf w_{[t]}^r}{\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^r}^{\top} =\mathbf I-\sum_{i=1}^{r}\mathbf w_{[t]}^i{\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^i}^{\top}.
\end{aligned}
\tag{26}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-113%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%20%26%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7Br-1%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%20I-%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bk%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cright)%20%3D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%20I-%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Br-1%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20w_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%20I-%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%20I-%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Br-1%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20w_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%20-%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%20%2B%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Br-1%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20w_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%20%5C%5Cleft(%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%5C%5Cright)%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%20I-%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Br-1%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20w_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%20-%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er-%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Br-1%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20w_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%20%5C%5Cleft(%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright)%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20w_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%20%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%20I-%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Br%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20w_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B26%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<p><strong style="color: var(--fgColor-danger)">WY 改变表示形式，保留每一步更新的先后顺序。</strong>合并以当前 key 为右因子的项，得到式（19）的 w 递推。块内写入项同理：从 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-114%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20u_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E1%3D%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E1%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20v_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E1%22%7D"></card> 出发，代入 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-115%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20H_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7Br-1%7D%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3Cr%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20u_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%22%7D"></card>，有</p>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\begin{aligned}
\mathbf H_{[t]}^r &amp;=\mathbf H_{[t]}^{r-1}\left(\mathbf I-\beta_{[t]}^r\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^r{\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^r}^{\top}\right) +\beta_{[t]}^r\boldsymbol v_{[t]}^r{\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^r}^{\top} =\left(\sum_{i=1}^{r-1}\mathbf u_{[t]}^i{\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^i}^{\top}\right) \left(\mathbf I-\beta_{[t]}^r\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^r{\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^r}^{\top}\right) +\beta_{[t]}^r\boldsymbol v_{[t]}^r{\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^r}^{\top}\\
&amp;=\sum_{i=1}^{r-1}\mathbf u_{[t]}^i{\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^i}^{\top} -\beta_{[t]}^r\sum_{i=1}^{r-1}\mathbf u_{[t]}^i \left({\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^i}^{\top}\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^r\right){\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^r}^{\top} +\beta_{[t]}^r\boldsymbol v_{[t]}^r{\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^r}^{\top}\\
&amp;=\sum_{i=1}^{r-1}\mathbf u_{[t]}^i{\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^i}^{\top} +\underbrace{\beta_{[t]}^r\left(\boldsymbol v_{[t]}^r-\sum_{i=1}^{r-1}\mathbf u_{[t]}^i \left({\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^i}^{\top}\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^r\right)\right)}_{\mathbf u_{[t]}^r}{\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^r}^{\top} =\sum_{i=1}^{r}\mathbf u_{[t]}^i{\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^i}^{\top}.
\end{aligned}
\tag{27}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-116%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%20H_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%20%26%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%20H_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7Br-1%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%20I-%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cright)%20%2B%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20v_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%20%3D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Br-1%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20u_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%20I-%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cright)%20%2B%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20v_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Br-1%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20u_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%20-%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Br-1%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20u_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%20%5C%5Cleft(%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%5C%5Cright)%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%20%2B%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20v_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Br-1%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20u_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%20%2B%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20v_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er-%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Br-1%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20u_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%20%5C%5Cleft(%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright)%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20u_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%20%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Br%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20u_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B27%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
</section><section class="lake-revised-section">
<h1 id="-ut-transform">🐢 UT Transform</h1>
<p>WY 给出累计变换的紧凑表示，但 w、u 的构造仍依赖先前位置，尚不能直接转成 Tensor Core 上的块级矩阵计算。<strong style="color: var(--fgColor-danger)">UT 将 W、U 的递推整理为同一个三角系统的两组右端项。</strong> 附录 B.2 从式（19）、（20）的行形式出发</p>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\begin{aligned}
\mathbf W_{[t]}[r,:]
&amp;=\beta_{[t]}^r\mathbf K_{[t]}[r,:]
 -\beta_{[t]}^r\sum_{i=1}^{r-1}\mathbf W_{[t]}[i,:]
 \left(\mathbf K_{[t]}[i,:]\mathbf K_{[t]}[r,:]^{\top}\right),\\
\mathbf U_{[t]}[r,:]
&amp;=\beta_{[t]}^r\mathbf V_{[t]}[r,:]
 -\beta_{[t]}^r\sum_{i=1}^{r-1}\mathbf U_{[t]}[i,:]
 \left(\mathbf K_{[t]}[i,:]\mathbf K_{[t]}[r,:]^{\top}\right).
\end{aligned}
\tag{28}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-117%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%20W_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Br%2C%3A%5D%5Cn%26%3D%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Br%2C%3A%5D%5Cn%20-%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Br-1%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20W_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Bi%2C%3A%5D%5Cn%20%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Bi%2C%3A%5D%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Br%2C%3A%5D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cright)%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%20U_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Br%2C%3A%5D%5Cn%26%3D%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%5C%5Cmathbf%20V_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Br%2C%3A%5D%5Cn%20-%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Br-1%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20U_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Bi%2C%3A%5D%5Cn%20%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Bi%2C%3A%5D%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Br%2C%3A%5D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cright).%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B28%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<p>令 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-118%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20B_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%22%7D"></card> 收集写入门，<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-119%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20L_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%22%7D"></card> 收集对先前位置的依赖系数</p>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\mathbf B_{[t]}=\operatorname{diag}(\beta_{[t]}),\qquad
\mathbf L_{[t]}=\operatorname{tril}\left(\mathbf B_{[t]}\mathbf K_{[t]}\mathbf K_{[t]}^{\top},-1\right).
\tag{29}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-120%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20B_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D)%2C%5C%5Cqquad%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%20L_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7Btril%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%20B_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%2C-1%5C%5Cright).%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B29%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<p>当 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-121%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22i%3Cr%22%7D"></card> 时，<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-122%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22(%5C%5Cmathbf%20L_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D)_%7Bri%7D%3D%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%22%7D"></card>，其余元素为零。利用内积的对称性，矩阵乘积的第 r 行恰好还原递推中的求和项</p>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="(\mathbf L_{[t]}\mathbf W_{[t]})[r,:] =\sum_{i=1}^{r-1}\beta_{[t]}^r \left(\mathbf K_{[t]}[r,:]\mathbf K_{[t]}[i,:]^{\top}\right)\mathbf W_{[t]}[i,:] =\beta_{[t]}^r\sum_{i=1}^{r-1}\mathbf W_{[t]}[i,:] \left(\mathbf K_{[t]}[i,:]\mathbf K_{[t]}[r,:]^{\top}\right).
\tag{30}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-123%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22(%5C%5Cmathbf%20L_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20W_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D)%5Br%2C%3A%5D%20%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Br-1%7D%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%20%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Br%2C%3A%5D%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Bi%2C%3A%5D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cmathbf%20W_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Bi%2C%3A%5D%20%3D%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Br-1%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20W_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Bi%2C%3A%5D%20%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Bi%2C%3A%5D%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Br%2C%3A%5D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cright).%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B30%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<p>移项得到 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-124%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20W_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%2B%5C%5Cmathbf%20L_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20W_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%20B_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%22%7D"></card>，U 同理。<strong style="color: var(--fgColor-danger)">UT 的核心是共享三角系统：W、U 使用同一单位下三角系数矩阵，差别仅在右端输入 K、V</strong></p>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="(\mathbf I+\mathbf L_{[t]})
\begin{bmatrix}\mathbf W_{[t]}&amp;\mathbf U_{[t]}\end{bmatrix}
=\mathbf B_{[t]}
\begin{bmatrix}\mathbf K_{[t]}&amp;\mathbf V_{[t]}\end{bmatrix}.
\tag{31}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-125%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22(%5C%5Cmathbf%20I%2B%5C%5Cmathbf%20L_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D)%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Bbmatrix%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20W_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%26%5C%5Cmathbf%20U_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cend%7Bbmatrix%7D%5Cn%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%20B_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Bbmatrix%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%26%5C%5Cmathbf%20V_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cend%7Bbmatrix%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B31%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<p><strong style="color: var(--fgColor-danger)">三角求解与递推等价，因为它们逐行求解同一组方程。</strong> <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-126%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20I%2B%5C%5Cmathbf%20L_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%22%7D"></card> 的对角线恒为 1，因而可逆；第 r 行仅依赖前 r−1 行，前向代入给出唯一解。附录 B.2 将共享的求解算子记为 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-127%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20T_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%22%7D"></card></p>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\mathbf T_{[t]}=(\mathbf I+\mathbf L_{[t]})^{-1}\mathbf B_{[t]},\qquad \mathbf W_{[t]}=(\mathbf I+\mathbf L_{[t]})^{-1}\mathbf B_{[t]}\mathbf K_{[t]} =\mathbf T_{[t]}\mathbf K_{[t]},\qquad \mathbf U_{[t]}=(\mathbf I+\mathbf L_{[t]})^{-1}\mathbf B_{[t]}\mathbf V_{[t]} =\mathbf T_{[t]}\mathbf V_{[t]}.
\tag{32}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-128%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20T_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%3D(%5C%5Cmathbf%20I%2B%5C%5Cmathbf%20L_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D)%5E%7B-1%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20B_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%2C%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cmathbf%20W_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%3D(%5C%5Cmathbf%20I%2B%5C%5Cmathbf%20L_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D)%5E%7B-1%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20B_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%20T_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%2C%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cmathbf%20U_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%3D(%5C%5Cmathbf%20I%2B%5C%5Cmathbf%20L_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D)%5E%7B-1%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20B_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20V_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%20%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%20T_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20V_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B32%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<p>以 V 替换 K 只改变右端项，系数矩阵仍由 K 与写入门决定。两组右端项可分别或拼接求解，逆矩阵记号不要求实现中显式求逆。将两组解代回式（18）</p>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\mathbf S_{[t]}^r =\mathbf S_{[t]}\left(\mathbf I-\sum_{i=1}^{r}\mathbf w_{[t]}^i{\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^i}^{\top}\right) +\sum_{i=1}^{r}\mathbf u_{[t]}^i{\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^i}^{\top} =\mathbf S_{[t]}+\sum_{i=1}^{r} \left(\mathbf u_{[t]}^i-\mathbf S_{[t]}\mathbf w_{[t]}^i\right){\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^i}^{\top}.
\tag{33}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-129%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%20%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%20I-%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Br%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20w_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cright)%20%2B%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Br%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20u_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%20%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%2B%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Br%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%20u_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei-%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20w_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%5C%5Cright)%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B33%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<p><strong style="color: var(--fgColor-danger)">W 编码对已有键值关联的纠正，U 汇集本块的写入系数</strong>：W 由 K 与写入门决定，U 还依赖 V。零初态下，<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-130%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20U_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%22%7D"></card> 即为块末记忆；存在历史状态时，则以 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-131%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20U_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D-%5C%5Cmathbf%20W_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%22%7D"></card> 作为有效写入</p>
<p>W、U 均不依赖入口状态，可跨 chunk 并行准备。入口状态到达后只需计算上述修正；若提前将状态合入三角系统的右端项，系数求解就会重新依赖前一个 chunk</p>
</section><section class="lake-revised-section">
<h1 id="-algorithm-hardware-efficient-chunkwise-training">🦦 Algorithm: Hardware-Efficient Chunkwise Training</h1>
<p>将衰减因子重新加入式（18），得到 GDN §3.3 的块内展开。入口记忆的累计变换记为 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-132%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20F_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%22%7D"></card>，块内累计写入记为 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-133%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20G_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%22%7D"></card></p>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\mathbf S_{[t]}^r=\mathbf S_{[t]}\underbrace{\left(\prod_{i=1}^{r}\alpha_{[t]}^i\left(\mathbf I-\beta_{[t]}^i\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^i{\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^i}^{\top}\right)\right)}_{\mathbf F_{[t]}^r}+\underbrace{\sum_{i=1}^{r}\left(\beta_{[t]}^i\boldsymbol v_{[t]}^i{\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^i}^{\top}\prod_{j=i+1}^{r}\alpha_{[t]}^j\left(\mathbf I-\beta_{[t]}^j\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^j{\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^j}^{\top}\right)\right)}_{\mathbf G_{[t]}^r}.
\tag{34}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-134%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cprod_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Br%7D%5C%5Calpha_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%20I-%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright)%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20F_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%2B%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Br%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20v_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cprod_%7Bj%3Di%2B1%7D%5E%7Br%7D%5C%5Calpha_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ej%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%20I-%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ej%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ej%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ej%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright)%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20G_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B34%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<p><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-135%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha%22%7D"></card> 可从矩阵连乘中提出，故 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-136%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20F_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%3D%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%5C%5Cmathbf%20P_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%22%7D"></card>。<strong style="color: var(--fgColor-danger)">入口记忆经历块首至当前位置的全部衰减，位置 i 的写入仅经历其后的衰减。</strong>相应的 WY 表示为</p>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\mathbf F_{[t]}^r=\gamma_{[t]}^r\left(\mathbf I-\sum_{i=1}^{r}\mathbf w_{[t]}^i{\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^i}^{\top}\right),\qquad \mathbf G_{[t]}^r=\sum_{i=1}^{r}\frac{\gamma_{[t]}^r}{\gamma_{[t]}^i}\widetilde{\mathbf u}_{[t]}^i{\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^i}^{\top}.
\tag{35}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-137%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20F_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%3D%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%20I-%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Br%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20w_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cright)%2C%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cmathbf%20G_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Br%7D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%7B%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%5C%5Cwidetilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20u%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B35%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<p><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-138%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cwidetilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20u%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%22%7D"></card> 从当前 value 中扣除历史写入在当前 key 上的关联，并计入位置 i 到 r 的衰减。其递推如下，归纳证明见论文附录 A</p>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\widetilde{\mathbf u}_{[t]}^r=\beta_{[t]}^r\left(\boldsymbol v_{[t]}^r-\sum_{i=1}^{r-1}\widetilde{\mathbf u}_{[t]}^i\left(\frac{\gamma_{[t]}^r}{\gamma_{[t]}^i}{\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^i}^{\top}\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^r\right)\right).
\tag{36}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-139%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cwidetilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20u%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%3D%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20v_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er-%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Br-1%7D%5C%5Cwidetilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20u%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%7B%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright).%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B36%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<p>式（36）定义带衰减的 WY 系数；将历史项移到左侧，建立单位下三角系统，再通过 UT 求解得到系数矩阵</p>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\widetilde{\mathbf U}_{[t]}=\left[\mathbf I+\operatorname{strictLower}\left(\operatorname{diag}(\beta_{[t]})\left(\Gamma_{[t]}\odot\mathbf K_{[t]}\mathbf K_{[t]}^{\top}\right)\right)\right]^{-1}\operatorname{diag}(\beta_{[t]})\mathbf V_{[t]}.
\tag{37}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-140%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cwidetilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20U%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%3D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cmathbf%20I%2B%5C%5Coperatorname%7BstrictLower%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D)%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5CGamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Codot%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5D%5E%7B-1%7D%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D)%5C%5Cmathbf%20V_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B37%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<p>将式（19）乘以 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-141%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%22%7D"></card>，代入论文定义 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-142%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20w%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%3D%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%5C%5Cmathbf%20w_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%22%7D"></card>，得到入口记忆修正系数的递推</p>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\overleftarrow{\mathbf w}_{[t]}^r=\gamma_{[t]}^r\mathbf w_{[t]}^r=\beta_{[t]}^r\gamma_{[t]}^r\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^r-\beta_{[t]}^r\sum_{i=1}^{r-1}\overleftarrow{\mathbf w}_{[t]}^i\left(\frac{\gamma_{[t]}^r}{\gamma_{[t]}^i}{\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^i}^{\top}\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^r\right).
\tag{38}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-143%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20w%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%3D%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%5C%5Cmathbf%20w_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%3D%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er-%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Br-1%7D%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20w%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%7B%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Ei%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%5C%5Cright).%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B38%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<p><strong style="color: var(--fgColor-danger)">两组递推共用单位下三角系数矩阵，仅右端项不同。</strong>将式（36）、（38）合写为</p>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\left[\mathbf I+\operatorname{strictLower}\left(\mathbf B_{[t]}\left(\Gamma_{[t]}\odot\mathbf K_{[t]}\mathbf K_{[t]}^{\top}\right)\right)\right]\begin{bmatrix}\widetilde{\mathbf U}_{[t]}&amp;\overleftarrow{\mathbf W}_{[t]}\end{bmatrix}=\mathbf B_{[t]}\begin{bmatrix}\mathbf V_{[t]}&amp;\operatorname{diag}(\gamma_{[t]})\mathbf K_{[t]}\end{bmatrix}.
\tag{39}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-144%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cmathbf%20I%2B%5C%5Coperatorname%7BstrictLower%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%20B_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5CGamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Codot%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5Cbegin%7Bbmatrix%7D%5C%5Cwidetilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20U%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%26%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20W%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cend%7Bbmatrix%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%20B_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cbegin%7Bbmatrix%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20V_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%26%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D)%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cend%7Bbmatrix%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B39%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<p>与式（37）对应，入口记忆的修正系数为</p>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\overleftarrow{\mathbf W}_{[t]}=\left[\mathbf I+\operatorname{strictLower}\left(\operatorname{diag}(\beta_{[t]})\left(\Gamma_{[t]}\odot\mathbf K_{[t]}\mathbf K_{[t]}^{\top}\right)\right)\right]^{-1}\operatorname{diag}(\beta_{[t]})\operatorname{diag}(\gamma_{[t]})\mathbf K_{[t]}.
\tag{40}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-145%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20W%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%3D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cmathbf%20I%2B%5C%5Coperatorname%7BstrictLower%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D)%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5CGamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Codot%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5D%5E%7B-1%7D%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D)%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D)%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B40%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<p><code>ut_system</code> 的严格下三角部分给出式（39）的非对角系数，<code>v_beta</code> 与 <code>decayed_k_beta</code> 是两组右端项。同时预计算块内读出权重 <code>intra_chunk_attn</code>，供式（42）使用</p>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-146%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20ut_system%2Fintra_chunk_attn%3A%20%5BB%2C%20H%2C%20num_chunks%2C%20chunk_size%2C%20chunk_size%5D%5Cnut_system%20%3D%20(k_beta%20%40%20key.transpose(-1%2C%20-2))%20*%20pairwise_decay%5Cn%23%20%E9%A2%84%E5%AD%98%20(Q%20K%5ET)%20%E2%8A%99%20%CE%93%EF%BC%9B%E6%AD%A4%E6%97%B6%20Q%2FK%20%E5%B0%9A%E6%9C%AA%E6%8C%89%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%8843%EF%BC%89%E9%87%8D%E5%8A%A0%E6%9D%83%5Cnintra_chunk_attn%20%3D%20(query%20%40%20key.transpose(-1%2C%20-2))%20*%20pairwise_decay%5Cn%23%20decayed_k_beta%3A%20%5BB%2C%20H%2C%20num_chunks%2C%20chunk_size%2C%20d_k%5D%5Cndecayed_k_beta%20%3D%20k_beta%20*%20cum_decay.exp().unsqueeze(-1)%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%7D"></card>
<ul>
<li><code>new_values</code> 对应 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-147%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cwidetilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20U%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%22%7D"></card>，<strong style="color: var(--fgColor-danger)">负责块内写入及各次写入之间的纠正</strong>。它从当前 value 中扣除先前写入经衰减后在当前 key 上的预测，给出零入口状态下的有效写入</li>
<li><code>k_cumdecay</code> 对应 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-148%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20W%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%22%7D"></card>，<strong style="color: var(--fgColor-danger)">负责块间历史对本块更新的修正</strong>。<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-149%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20W%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%22%7D"></card> 汇集入口记忆的预测及其引起的块内后续纠正，从 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-150%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cwidetilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20U%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%22%7D"></card> 中扣除这一项，才得到实际有效写入。两组系数均可由当前块输入预计算；跨块传递的是 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-151%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%22%7D"></card></li>
</ul>
<p><code>upper=False</code> 选择下三角，<code>unitriangular=True</code> 忽略原对角元素并将其视为 1；导出分支改为先构造系统的逆，再乘两组右端项</p>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-152%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22if%20not%20is_torchdynamo_exporting()%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20new_values%20%3D%20torch.linalg.solve_triangular(ut_system%2C%20v_beta%2C%20upper%3DFalse%2C%20unitriangular%3DTrue)%5Cn%20%20%20%20k_cumdecay%20%3D%20torch.linalg.solve_triangular(ut_system%2C%20decayed_k_beta%2C%20upper%3DFalse%2C%20unitriangular%3DTrue)%5Cnelse%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20ut_system%20%3D%20-ut_system.tril(-1)%5Cn%20%20%20%20for%20i%20in%20range(1%2C%20chunk_size)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20row%20%3D%20ut_system%5B...%2C%20i%2C%20%3Ai%5D.clone()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20sub%20%3D%20ut_system%5B...%2C%20%3Ai%2C%20%3Ai%5D.clone()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20ut_system%5B...%2C%20i%2C%20%3Ai%5D%20%3D%20row%20%2B%20(row.unsqueeze(-1)%20*%20sub).sum(-2)%5Cn%20%20%20%20ut_system%20%3D%20ut_system%20%2B%20torch.eye(chunk_size%2C%20dtype%3Dut_system.dtype%2C%20device%3Dut_system.device)%5Cn%20%20%20%20new_values%2C%20k_cumdecay%20%3D%20ut_system%20%40%20v_beta%2C%20ut_system%20%40%20decayed_k_beta%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%7D"></card>
</section><section class="lake-revised-section">
<h1 id="-chunk-state-and-output">🐬 Chunk State and Output</h1>
<p><code>torch_chunk_gated_delta_rule</code> 接收 Q/K/V、对数衰减 <code>g</code>、更新门 <code>beta</code> 和可选的入口状态 <code>initial_state</code>。返回 <strong style="color: var(--fgColor-danger)"><code>core_attn_out</code>：当前序列的逐 token 输出；<code>last_recurrent_state</code>：序列末尾的递推状态</strong>，后者仅在 <code>output_final_state=True</code> 时返回，否则为 <code>None</code></p>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\mathbf S_{[t+1]}={\color{blue}\overrightarrow{\mathbf S}_{[t]}}+\left(\widetilde{\mathbf U}_{[t]}-{\color{blue}\overleftarrow{\mathbf W}_{[t]}}\mathbf S_{[t]}^{\top}\right)^{\top}{\color{blue}\overrightarrow{\mathbf K}_{[t]}}\in\mathbb R^{d_v\times d_k}.
\tag{41}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-153%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7B%5Bt%2B1%5D%7D%3D%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bblue%7D%5C%5Coverrightarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20S%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%7D%2B%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cwidetilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20U%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D-%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bblue%7D%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20W%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cright)%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bblue%7D%5C%5Coverrightarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20K%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%20R%5E%7Bd_v%5C%5Ctimes%20d_k%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B41%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\mathbf O_{[t]}={\color{blue}\overleftarrow{\mathbf Q}_{[t]}}\mathbf S_{[t]}^{\top}+\left((\mathbf Q_{[t]}\mathbf K_{[t]}^{\top})\odot\Gamma_{[t]}\right)\left(\widetilde{\mathbf U}_{[t]}-{\color{blue}\overleftarrow{\mathbf W}_{[t]}}\mathbf S_{[t]}^{\top}\right)\in\mathbb R^{C\times d_v}.
\tag{42}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-154%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20O_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%3D%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bblue%7D%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20Q%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%2B%5C%5Cleft((%5C%5Cmathbf%20Q_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20K_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D)%5C%5Codot%5C%5CGamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cwidetilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20U%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D-%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bblue%7D%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20W%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%20R%5E%7BC%5C%5Ctimes%20d_v%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B42%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<p>蓝色箭头由累计衰减定义</p>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="{\color{blue}\overleftarrow{\boldsymbol q}_{[t]}^r}=\gamma_{[t]}^r\boldsymbol q_{[t]}^r,\qquad {\color{blue}\overleftarrow{\mathbf W}_{[t]}}=\operatorname{diag}(\gamma_{[t]})\mathbf W_{[t]},\qquad {\color{blue}\overrightarrow{\boldsymbol k}_{[t]}^r}=\frac{\gamma_{[t]}^C}{\gamma_{[t]}^r}\boldsymbol k_{[t]}^r,\qquad {\color{blue}\overrightarrow{\mathbf S}_{[t]}}=\gamma_{[t]}^C\mathbf S_{[t]}.
\tag{43}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-155%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bblue%7D%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20q%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%3D%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20q_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%2C%5C%5Cqquad%20%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bblue%7D%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20W%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%7D%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D)%5C%5Cmathbf%20W_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%2C%5C%5Cqquad%20%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bblue%7D%5C%5Coverrightarrow%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5EC%7D%7B%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%20k_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5Er%2C%5C%5Cqquad%20%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bblue%7D%5C%5Coverrightarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20S%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%7D%3D%5C%5Cgamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5EC%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B43%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<p>GDN §3.3 的输出原式此处写作 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-156%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22M%22%7D"></card>；式（42）按递推关系与源码使用 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-157%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CGamma_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%22%7D"></card>，因为仅用二值因果掩码会漏掉块内写入的传播衰减。实现先接续缓存状态，无缓存时从零状态开始</p>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-158%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20last_recurrent_state%3A%20%5BB%2C%20H%2C%20d_k%2C%20d_v%5D%5Cnif%20initial_state%20is%20None%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20last_recurrent_state%20%3D%20torch.zeros(recurrent_state_shape%2C%20dtype%3Dnew_values.dtype%2C%20device%3Dnew_values.device)%5Cnelse%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20last_recurrent_state%20%3D%20initial_state.to(new_values)%5Cncore_attn_out%20%3D%20torch.zeros_like(new_values)%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%7D"></card>
<p>随后按式（43）重加权 Q、K，并准备入口状态的整块衰减因子。此前计算的 <code>intra_chunk_attn</code> 保持不变</p>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-159%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22query%20%3D%20query%20*%20cum_decay.exp().unsqueeze(-1)%5Cnkey%20%3D%20key%20*%20(cum_decay%5B...%2C%20-1%3A%5D%20-%20cum_decay).exp().unsqueeze(-1)%5Cnchunk_decay%20%3D%20cum_decay%5B...%2C%20-1%5D.exp()%5B...%2C%20None%2C%20None%5D%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%7D"></card>
<p><code>v_new</code> 对应有效写入 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-160%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cwidetilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20U%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D-%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20W%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%22%7D"></card>，缓存按 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-161%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%22%7D"></card> 存储。式（42）的第一项由 <code>inter_chunk_attn</code> 计算，即 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-math-162%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coverleftarrow%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20Q%7D_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20S_%7B%5Bt%5D%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%22%7D"></card>；第二项由预存的 <code>intra_chunk_attn</code> 乘 <code>v_new</code> 得到。<strong style="color: var(--fgColor-danger)">入口记忆的读出与块内有效写入的贡献相加，构成当前 chunk 的输出</strong>。循环末行按式（41）的转置形式更新缓存</p>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-163%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22for%20i%20in%20range(num_chunks)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20v_new%20%3D%20new_values%5B%3A%2C%20%3A%2C%20i%5D%20-%20k_cumdecay%5B%3A%2C%20%3A%2C%20i%5D%20%40%20last_recurrent_state%5Cn%20%20%20%20inter_chunk_attn%20%3D%20query%5B%3A%2C%20%3A%2C%20i%5D%20%40%20last_recurrent_state%5Cn%20%20%20%20core_attn_out%5B%3A%2C%20%3A%2C%20i%5D%20%3D%20inter_chunk_attn%20%2B%20intra_chunk_attn%5B%3A%2C%20%3A%2C%20i%5D%20%40%20v_new%5Cn%20%20%20%20last_recurrent_state%20%3D%20last_recurrent_state%20*%20chunk_decay%5B%3A%2C%20%3A%2C%20i%5D%20%2B%20key%5B%3A%2C%20%3A%2C%20i%5D.transpose(-1%2C%20-2)%20%40%20v_new%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%7D"></card>
<p>扫描结束后，从输出中裁去补齐位置并恢复输入布局与精度，按需返回末尾递推状态</p>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22import-code-164%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22last_recurrent_state%20%3D%20None%20if%20not%20output_final_state%20else%20last_recurrent_state%5Cncore_attn_out%20%3D%20core_attn_out.reshape(padded_output_shape)%5Cncore_attn_out%20%3D%20core_attn_out%5B%3A%2C%20%3A%2C%20%3Asequence_length%5D%5Cn%23%20core_attn_out%3A%20%5BB%2C%20sequence_length%2C%20H%2C%20d_v%5D%5Cncore_attn_out%20%3D%20core_attn_out.transpose(1%2C%202).to(initial_dtype%2C%20memory_format%3Dtorch.contiguous_format)%5Cnreturn%20core_attn_out%2C%20last_recurrent_state%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22%22%7D"></card>
</section>
